 macOS asks for microphone access so Otter can transcribe what you say\",\"button\":\"Enable access\"},\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Enable microphone access\",\"description\":\"Find Otter in the list and turn it on so Otter can transcribe what you say\",\"button\":\"Enable access\",\"windows_description\":\"Open Windows microphone privacy settings, find Otter in the list, and turn it on so Otter can transcribe what you say\"}},\"screen\":{\"title\":\"Enable screen \u0026 audio recording\",\"description\":\"This allows Otter to capture what's on screen and what meeting participants say\",\"button\":\"Enable access\",\"name\":\"Screen and system audio recording\",\"purpose\":\"To capture meeting audio\"},\"accessibility\":{\"title\":\"Enable accessibility access\",\"description\":\"Otter uses accessibility permissions to improve meeting accuracy and support collaboration features.\",\"button\":\"Enable access\",\"skip\":\"Skip\",\"name\":\"Accessibility\",\"purpose\":\"Improve meeting accuracy\"},\"granted\":{\"title\":\"One click to record, bot-free\",\"title_v2\":\"All set! Otter is ready\",\"description\":\"Otter Desktop App can record your computer's audio directly, with no AI Notetaker bot joining meetings.\",\"button_start\":\"Start using Otter\",\"button_restart\":\"Restart app to use Otter\"},\"restart_prompt\":\"\u003clink\u003eRestart the app\u003c/link\u003e for the changes to take effect, after enabling access.\"},\"tabs\":{\"tab_limit_reached\":\"You've reached the maximum number of tabs. Close a tab to open a new one.\",\"new_tab\":{\"title\":\"New Tab\",\"recents_subtitle\":\"Recents\"}}},\"get-started\":{\"title\":\"Get started\",\"completed_title\":\"You are all set! 🎉\",\"completed_desc\":\"Time to unlock even more productivity.\",\"checklist\":{\"connect_calendar\":\"Sync calendar for automatic notes\",\"sample_speech\":\"Learn the basics\",\"recording_tutorial\":\"Record my first conversation\",\"import_file_personal\":\"Transcribe your first file\",\