.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"43 secs\"},\"translateInAiChat\":{\"title\":\"Instantly translate transcripts and summaries\",\"subtitle\":\"Get answers from AI Chat in your language from any meeting.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"43 secs\"}},\"apps\":{\"desktopApp\":{\"title\":\"Using the desktop app for Windows \u0026 Mac\",\"subtitle\":\"Record directly from your computer without a bot joining the call.\"},\"mobileApp\":{\"title\":\"Recording on-the-go for iOS and Android\",\"subtitle\":\"Capture in-person conversations or events wherever you are.\"},\"chromeExtension\":{\"title\":\"Recording website audio with the Chrome extension\",\"subtitle\":\"Capture Google Meet audio from any browser tab with one click.\"}},\"integrations\":{\"chatgpt\":{\"title\":\"Ask ChatGPT questions grounded in your Otter meeting recordings.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"3 mins\"},\"claude\":{\"title\":\"Let Claude use your Otter meeting data to take action.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"3 mins\"},\"cursor\":{\"title\":\"Use Otter meeting context to build software in Cursor.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"3 mins\"},\"perplexity\":{\"title\":\"Bring Otter into Perplexity for answers grounded in your meeting context.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"3 mins\"},\"zapier\":{\"title\":\"Use Zapier to connect Otter to thousands of apps.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"5 mins\"},\"slack\":{\"title\":\"Share meeting summaries and action items directly to your Slack channels.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"1 min\"},\"hubspot\":{\"title\":\"Automatically update HubSpot after every meeting.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"53 secs\"},\"salesforce\":{\"title\":\"Keep Salesforce records current with meeting insights.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"25 secs\"}}}}},\"otter-chat\":{\"untitledSession\":\"Untitled Session\",\"channel\":\"Channel\",\"note\":\"Note\",\"folder\":\"Folder\",\"artifact\":{\"downloadAndOpen\":\"Download\"},\"agenticActionItem\":{\"draftEmailPrompt\":\"Can you help draft an email for this action item? \\\"{text}\\\"\",\"proposeCalendarTimesPrompt\":\"Can you propose some calendar times for this action item? \\\"{tex